11
00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:38.096
Option C is unsafe because Forwarding spreads the lure

12
00:00:38.096 --> 00:00:41.425
and does not verify its authenticity. In practice: Open

13
00:00:41.425 --> 00:00:44.753
the courier app or enter its known address yourself.

14
00:00:44.753 --> 00:00:48.452
Report and delete the suspicious message according to local procedures.

15
00:00:48.452 --> 00:00:51.781
Key takeaway: Unexpected delivery texts with short links and

16
00:00:51.781 --> 00:00:54.000
urgent fees should be checked independently.
